(6188208, 913868, 17153, '<td valign="top">the graduated border is distracting, it would look better without it. also his eyes are too dark. you could use a higher power for flash and stand further away with your lens more extended towards telephoto.</td>', 'the graduated border is distracting, it would look better without it. also his eyes are too dark. you could use a higher power for flash and stand further away with your lens more extended towards telephoto.', '2010-10-11 06:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
