(6188286, 913899, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  The blurred diagonal line pulls us right back to him.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  The blurred diagonal line pulls us right back to him.', '2010-10-11 09:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188289, 913387, 15711, '<td valign="top">Hands down the best one that''s popped up so far.  I would seriously give it a 10 but didn''t want to "cheat" since I know it''s yours.  The diagonal line of light leads us right back to her.  The hint of back lighting around her head - perfection.  I love the title too.  Good luck Mary.  This is certainly a winner in my book!</td>', 'Hands down the best one that''s popped up so far.  I would seriously give it a 10 but didn''t want to "cheat" since I know it''s yours.  The diagonal line of light leads us right back to her.  The hint of back lighting around her head - perfection.  I love the title too.  Good luck Mary.  This is certainly a winner in my book!', '2010-10-11 09:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188290, 913875, 15711, '<td valign="top">Parents pay big bucks for kids'' portraits such as these. I love the tilt.  What a bright shiny face. :)</td>', 'Parents pay big bucks for kids'' portraits such as these. I love the tilt.  What a bright shiny face. :)', '2010-10-11 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188291, 913908, 15711, '<td valign="top">That horse!!!!  How wonderful.</td>', 'That horse!!!!  How wonderful.', '2010-10-11 09:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188292, 913573, 15711, '<td valign="top">You may not know there is an old song by that title.  It''s perfect for this.  I like it. :)</td>', 'You may not know there is an old song by that title.  It''s perfect for this.  I like it. :)', '2010-10-11 09:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188293, 913902, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is oddly wonderful.  I love the diagonal shadow.  Poor thing.</td>', 'This is oddly wonderful.  I love the diagonal shadow.  Poor thing.', '2010-10-11 09:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188295, 913683, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m not a lover of fill flash personally, but this certainly has a professional edge.  Looks like an ad photo in a glossy mens'' magazine.  Well done.</td>', 'I''m not a lover of fill flash personally, but this certainly has a professional edge.  Looks like an ad photo in a glossy mens'' magazine.  Well done.', '2010-10-11 09:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188296, 913872, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think I would like this much more if she weren''t wearing the mask.  Just a personal preference.  It certainly has an edgy avant garde feel. :) 7</td>', 'I think I would like this much more if she weren''t wearing the mask.  Just a personal preference.  It certainly has an edgy avant garde feel. :) 7', '2010-10-11 09:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188297, 913802, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh god, that is darling!!!!!</td>', 'Oh god, that is darling!!!!!', '2010-10-11 09:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188318, 913683, 54446, '<td valign="top">Superb lighting in all respects.  Should ribbon.  My favorite in this challenge.</td>', 'Superb lighting in all respects.  Should ribbon.  My favorite in this challenge.', '2010-10-11 10:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188335, 913677, 24642, '<td valign="top">Well done, classic composition.  Sky looks a bit strange.</td>', 'Well done, classic composition.  Sky looks a bit strange.', '2010-10-11 10:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188346, 913844, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very well done! From the colors, to the depth of field, to the sparkle in her eyes.</td>', 'Very well done! From the colors, to the depth of field, to the sparkle in her eyes.', '2010-10-11 10:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188347, 913856, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good use of fill flash to bring out the details in her hair/face, without overdoing it. I like the choice of B&amp;W here. I also think vignetting would have been a good choice for this photo.</td>', 'Good use of fill flash to bring out the details in her hair/face, without overdoing it. I like the choice of B&W here. I also think vignetting would have been a good choice for this photo.', '2010-10-11 10:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188348, 913666, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall, this is a decent photo. What keeps it from being great is too much vignetting (in my eyes), the feeling of over-sharpening, and the half covered face.</td>', 'Overall, this is a decent photo. What keeps it from being great is too much vignetting (in my eyes), the feeling of over-sharpening, and the half covered face.', '2010-10-11 10:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188350, 913907, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job taking what feels like an ordinary snapshot, and turning it into something a bit more. Good subtle colors and nice job keeping out reflections on the gold.</td>', 'Nice job taking what feels like an ordinary snapshot, and turning it into something a bit more. Good subtle colors and nice job keeping out reflections on the gold.', '2010-10-11 10:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188352, 913661, 114225, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I think you are going to get blasted for using flash as the only light source instead of a fill flash. For me, the subject matter just isn''t interesting.</td>', 'Hmm, I think you are going to get blasted for using flash as the only light source instead of a fill flash. For me, the subject matter just isn''t interesting.', '2010-10-11 10:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188353, 913683, 80904, '<td valign="top">I would have saved this one for the FS. This is not an example of fill flash in my Opinion, but a great example of flash</td>', 'I would have saved this one for the FS. This is not an example of fill flash in my Opinion, but a great example of flash', '2010-10-11 10:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188355, 913692, 114225, '<td valign="top">A good full length portrait that brings out your personality. I would suggest going a bit easier on the Sharpening, as it really has created a lot of jagged edges.</td>', 'A good full length portrait that brings out your personality. I would suggest going a bit easier on the Sharpening, as it really has created a lot of jagged edges.', '2010-10-11 10:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188363, 913746, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job getting a good color and exposure balance on this shot. I tried to do something similar, but failed miserably.</td>', 'Nice job getting a good color and exposure balance on this shot. I tried to do something similar, but failed miserably.', '2010-10-11 11:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188366, 913133, 114225, '<td valign="top">A cute photo, and nice use of the flash to start balancing the exposure, but this has just a bit too much of an over-processed feeling to me (especially the halo effect at the edge of the wood and around her head.</td>', 'A cute photo, and nice use of the flash to start balancing the exposure, but this has just a bit too much of an over-processed feeling to me (especially the halo effect at the edge of the wood and around her head.', '2010-10-11 11:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188369, 913220, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great processing of this shot. The color cast chosen is perfect for her skin tone, and the contrast is just right as well.</td>', 'Great processing of this shot. The color cast chosen is perfect for her skin tone, and the contrast is just right as well.', '2010-10-11 11:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188370, 913833, 113419, '<td valign="top">beautifully done</td>', 'beautifully done', '2010-10-11 11:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188374, 913890, 113419, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL - very well done as your fill flash is nice on soft on the subject</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL - very well done as your fill flash is nice on soft on the subject', '2010-10-11 11:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188376, 913666, 113419, '<td valign="top">nice capture, good work with your fill flash, great title (cause it looks like the doe is wearing an eye patch!)</td>', 'nice capture, good work with your fill flash, great title (cause it looks like the doe is wearing an eye patch!)', '2010-10-11 11:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188380, 913860, 113419, '<td valign="top">the tall plant in the background is very distracting - it really takes away from the nice soft colors</td>', 'the tall plant in the background is very distracting - it really takes away from the nice soft colors', '2010-10-11 11:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188421, 913880, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great pose and setup of the model. Excellent use of the sun as a highlight. I can see you used the flash by the reflection in the glasses. I also like the B&amp;W conversion. Something I noted immediately is the photo is not the sharpest...</td>', 'Great pose and setup of the model. Excellent use of the sun as a highlight. I can see you used the flash by the reflection in the glasses. I also like the B&W conversion. Something I noted immediately is the photo is not the sharpest...', '2010-10-11 11:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6188424, 913664, 10785, '<td valign="top">The only evidence of fill flash is the small catch lights in the horses eyes, and that is a good thing!</td>', 'The only evidence of fill flash is the small catch lights in the horses eyes, and that is a good thing!', '2010-10-11 11:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
