(6189516, 913802, 20799, '<td valign="top">My winner :).</td>', 'My winner :).', '2010-10-12 16:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189582, 913681, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting subject, and good conditions to use a fill flash. My main suggestion for bringing this up to score higher would be a closer crop. I think the branch on the left and all of the bright background are pretty major distractions.</td>', 'This is an interesting subject, and good conditions to use a fill flash. My main suggestion for bringing this up to score higher would be a closer crop. I think the branch on the left and all of the bright background are pretty major distractions.', '2010-10-12 18:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189587, 913860, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice scene overall, but I gave this an average score. I think it could have been improved in two ways:<br/>- Start the main subject from a corner instead of just offset. I believe that simple change would actually make a big impact on perspective<br/>- Balance the light from the flash a bit better with the ambient light. This is especially true for the color, the flash is just too cool in comparison to the warm sunset.</td>', 'Nice scene overall, but I gave this an average score. I think it could have been improved in two ways:- Start the main subject from a corner instead of just offset. I believe that simple change would actually make a big impact on perspective- Balance the light from the flash a bit better with the ambient light. This is especially true for the color, the flash is just too cool in comparison to the warm sunset.', '2010-10-12 18:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189590, 913855, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of using two flashes, I definitely like that. I also like the scene and leading line. I think I would use less of the ground lit up. Maybe if the flash concentrated more on the guy, that would have been better.</td>', 'Interesting choice of using two flashes, I definitely like that. I also like the scene and leading line. I think I would use less of the ground lit up. Maybe if the flash concentrated more on the guy, that would have been better.', '2010-10-12 18:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189594, 913754, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like what you were going for here, but I think a few things could have helped improved this shot. I don''t really care for the big tree in the background, it''s blocking my view of the shy, so maybe a different angle could have been used. Also, the flash is really bright. I would have liked this more if the flash balanced the ambient light more.</td>', 'I like what you were going for here, but I think a few things could have helped improved this shot. I don''t really care for the big tree in the background, it''s blocking my view of the shy, so maybe a different angle could have been used. Also, the flash is really bright. I would have liked this more if the flash balanced the ambient light more.', '2010-10-12 18:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189595, 913802, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the center composition for this quirky shot. I think I would have chosen a different crop, so we didn''t see so much of the other elements in the photo (pretty distracting to me).</td>', 'I like the center composition for this quirky shot. I think I would have chosen a different crop, so we didn''t see so much of the other elements in the photo (pretty distracting to me).', '2010-10-12 18:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189600, 913814, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute photo, but it hits me as too much of a quick snapshot. I think it could be improved with:<br/>- Better crop so you didn''t cut off parts of the dog, and had less of the front step<br/>- Diffused the light from the flash so it looked more natural.</td>', 'Cute photo, but it hits me as too much of a quick snapshot. I think it could be improved with:- Better crop so you didn''t cut off parts of the dog, and had less of the front step- Diffused the light from the flash so it looked more natural.', '2010-10-12 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189603, 913804, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice color to the sunlight. What''s really hurting this photo in my eyes is the lack of extreme sharpness, and the difference in color of the flash (cool/neutral) and the sun (warm).</td>', 'Nice color to the sunlight. What''s really hurting this photo in my eyes is the lack of extreme sharpness, and the difference in color of the flash (cool/neutral) and the sun (warm).', '2010-10-12 18:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189604, 913700, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a good perspective, and the colors outside of the lower left are great. But I''m not a big fan of the time-lapse-ghost effect.</td>', 'This is a good perspective, and the colors outside of the lower left are great. But I''m not a big fan of the time-lapse-ghost effect.', '2010-10-12 18:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189606, 913522, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great colors in this scene, and good balance between flash and ambient light. I''m slightly torn by the perspective. On one hand, I like the in-the-forest feel, but on the other hand I wish I could see more. I definitely appreciate the photo though.</td>', 'Great colors in this scene, and good balance between flash and ambient light. I''m slightly torn by the perspective. On one hand, I like the in-the-forest feel, but on the other hand I wish I could see more. I definitely appreciate the photo though.', '2010-10-12 18:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189607, 913875, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great use of color to pop the subject against the background. Nice balance of light here as well. I''m not too keen on the exaggerated angle. It feels like he''s going to fall over.</td>', 'Great use of color to pop the subject against the background. Nice balance of light here as well. I''m not too keen on the exaggerated angle. It feels like he''s going to fall over.', '2010-10-12 18:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189610, 913751, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice balance of the flash light against the ambient light. I really enjoy the composition chosen for this photo. I do think if he were wearing khakis or similar style pants that it would have improved the photo (the color of the jeans is just really sticking out at me).</td>', 'Very nice balance of the flash light against the ambient light. I really enjoy the composition chosen for this photo. I do think if he were wearing khakis or similar style pants that it would have improved the photo (the color of the jeans is just really sticking out at me).', '2010-10-12 18:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189611, 913880, 114225, '<td valign="top">Really nice job with balancing the flash power against the sunlight. I''m not fully sure about the pose, but I think it brings out some of her style/attitude, so in the end I like it.</td>', 'Really nice job with balancing the flash power against the sunlight. I''m not fully sure about the pose, but I think it brings out some of her style/attitude, so in the end I like it.', '2010-10-12 18:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189651, 913220, 88136, '<td valign="top">beautiful dress</td>', 'beautiful dress', '2010-10-12 19:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189655, 913802, 88136, '<td valign="top">ha!! funny</td>', 'ha!! funny', '2010-10-12 19:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189662, 913804, 121073, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t seem to be in focus, unfortunately.</td>', 'It doesn''t seem to be in focus, unfortunately.', '2010-10-12 19:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189667, 913751, 121073, '<td valign="top">I love it, just the right amount of flash!</td>', 'I love it, just the right amount of flash!', '2010-10-12 19:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189671, 913683, 121073, '<td valign="top">Nice mix of clothing! :)</td>', 'Nice mix of clothing! :)', '2010-10-12 19:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
