(6190756, 913693, 68586, '<td valign="top">Great lighting on the dog - can''t quite decide whether the surroundings are slightly distracting - or help contextualise the situation .  . cool angle on the dog which helps lift it out the norm slightly, I guess the only thing that would have finished this for me would have been a catch light in it''s eyes.<br/> <br/>Still a striking shot though that should do well.<br/> <br/> :- )</td>', 'Great lighting on the dog - can''t quite decide whether the surroundings are slightly distracting - or help contextualise the situation .  . cool angle on the dog which helps lift it out the norm slightly, I guess the only thing that would have finished this for me would have been a catch light in it''s eyes. Still a striking shot though that should do well.  :- )', '2010-10-13 14:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6190757, 913220, 68586, '<td valign="top">Lots to like about this shot :- )<br/> <br/>My only slight critique is that the eyes get a bit lost in shadow, which breaks the contact with the model for me. But a nice shot all the same.</td>', 'Lots to like about this shot :- ) My only slight critique is that the eyes get a bit lost in shadow, which breaks the contact with the model for me. But a nice shot all the same.', '2010-10-13 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6190759, 913710, 68586, '<td valign="top">Thsi reminds me of the old Larson cartoon ''When Imprinting Goes Wrong''  lol<br/> <br/>Or maybe he''s just drunk enough that he''s glad to have any bird to go home with at the end of the evening  :- )<br/> <br/>Good shot - made me laugh</td>', 'Thsi reminds me of the old Larson cartoon ''When Imprinting Goes Wrong''  lol Or maybe he''s just drunk enough that he''s glad to have any bird to go home with at the end of the evening  :- ) Good shot - made me laugh', '2010-10-13 14:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6190760, 913802, 68586, '<td valign="top">Oliver Twist - the Sheep version . .  <br/> <br/>There''s only one mind this could have come from  <br/> <br/> :- P</td>', 'Oliver Twist - the Sheep version . .   There''s only one mind this could have come from    :- P', '2010-10-13 14:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6190761, 913317, 68586, '<td valign="top">Great pattern &amp; textures</td>', 'Great pattern & textures', '2010-10-13 14:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6190768, 913811, 68586, '<td valign="top">This is a tremendous shot - love it !!<br/> <br/>I would love this to win simply so I could show it to my dog and let him realise that posing like this is ok and he wouldn''t need to tear the tie off - chew it, then hide the remains somewhere outside . .<br/> <br/> :- )</td>', 'This is a tremendous shot - love it !! I would love this to win simply so I could show it to my dog and let him realise that posing like this is ok and he wouldn''t need to tear the tie off - chew it, then hide the remains somewhere outside . .  :- )', '2010-10-13 14:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6190769, 913812, 68586, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting</td>', 'Excellent lighting', '2010-10-13 14:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
