(6190786, 913750, 101702, '<td valign="top">You crack me up! I so want to see this one on the front page! Strangely I''m really having a hard time stopping my eyes from wandering down from her face. Not sure if that''s a good thing or a bad thing. Sea looks pretty beautiful too!</td>', 'You crack me up! I so want to see this one on the front page! Strangely I''m really having a hard time stopping my eyes from wandering down from her face. Not sure if that''s a good thing or a bad thing. Sea looks pretty beautiful too!', '2010-10-13 14:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
