(6191613, 913683, 101702, '<td valign="top">You seem to be on a roll lately with regards to creativity (and self-portraits). I expect once again for this to be top 5, maybe a ribbon. You have too much time on your hands!</td>', 'You seem to be on a roll lately with regards to creativity (and self-portraits). I expect once again for this to be top 5, maybe a ribbon. You have too much time on your hands!', '2010-10-14 12:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
