(6191618, 913803, 101702, '<td valign="top">Amusing, but this shot would have been so much better if all that stuff in the background was out of shot - maybe holding a piece of card or something behind the woody to isolate him. As it stands, it just seems a very cluttered shot.</td>', 'Amusing, but this shot would have been so much better if all that stuff in the background was out of shot - maybe holding a piece of card or something behind the woody to isolate him. As it stands, it just seems a very cluttered shot.', '2010-10-14 12:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
