(6192946, 913317, 101702, '<td valign="top">This one doesn''t really work for me. Feels like there is only the one light source and no fill flash. I may be mistaken of course especially if this was very subtly done. Nonetheless, the balance of the shot doesn''t feel right compositionally to me. Maybe if the converging lines met at an intersection of thirds rather than centrally the balance would feel better.</td>', 'This one doesn''t really work for me. Feels like there is only the one light source and no fill flash. I may be mistaken of course especially if this was very subtly done. Nonetheless, the balance of the shot doesn''t feel right compositionally to me. Maybe if the converging lines met at an intersection of thirds rather than centrally the balance would feel better.', '2010-10-16 08:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
