(6194524, 913802, 67145, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hotpasta:</b></div><hr/><i> ROZ! It''s not an insect!!! Great shot...I take it your lens was not a 100mm, but rather a fisheye? well done on a top 10 finish </i></td></tr></table> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by daisydavid:</b></div><hr/><i> I loved this one, I''m sure there''s a bug in there somewhere. But did you use the macro &amp; not a wide angle lens? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>oops .. had lens 100mm which is totally unbelievable .. !! .. its taken with the 15mm fisheye on full frame .. the 100mm goes in automatically when i upload a pic and i didnt notice .. thanks enzo and john for pointing that out .. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-10-18 08:20:08.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by hotpasta: ROZ! It''s not an insect!!! Great shot...I take it your lens was not a 100mm, but rather a fisheye? well done on a top 10 finish  Originally posted by daisydavid: I loved this one, I''m sure there''s a bug in there somewhere. But did you use the macro & not a wide angle lens?   oops .. had lens 100mm which is totally unbelievable .. !! .. its taken with the 15mm fisheye on full frame .. the 100mm goes in automatically when i upload a pic and i didnt notice .. thanks enzo and john for pointing that out .. :)', '2010-10-18 09:18:26.000000', '2010-10-18 09:20:08.000000', 0),
