(6195995, 913133, 23317, '<td valign="top">You''ve covered what my comments would have been with your post-entry analysis.  I''d probably bring the blue out of her eyes a bit more, or really the brightness of the blues (the color is already there).  And reducing the halo around her hair as well as the wood railing would be good.<br/> <br/>Such a beautiful girl with fantastic eyes anyway though, it''s fairly easy to make her look good.</td>', 'You''ve covered what my comments would have been with your post-entry analysis.  I''d probably bring the blue out of her eyes a bit more, or really the brightness of the blues (the color is already there).  And reducing the halo around her hair as well as the wood railing would be good. Such a beautiful girl with fantastic eyes anyway though, it''s fairly easy to make her look good.', '2010-10-19 22:04:05.000000', NULL, 0),
