(6196363, 913859, 41337, '<td valign="top">To fuse <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=68504" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tnun</a>''s and <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">posthumous</a>'' comments together what we have here is an innocent nightmare or is it nightmarishly innocent?</td>', 'To fuse  tnun''s and  posthumous'' comments together what we have here is an innocent nightmare or is it nightmarishly innocent?', '2010-10-20 03:56:29.000000', NULL, 0),
