(6517128, 913680, 63218, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10 because of the raking light &amp; because of the extra room at the top, which allows the bird of my imagination to fly above the clouds of smoke &amp; the topography over the coals. Crop it to follow ROT more exactly, &amp; the clouds are just smoke. Cropping out the arm''s body &amp; head give it &amp; its shadow great storytelling power because I get to create most of the story myself. The color, of course, is terrific.</td>', 'I gave this a 10 because of the raking light & because of the extra room at the top, which allows the bird of my imagination to fly above the clouds of smoke & the topography over the coals. Crop it to follow ROT more exactly, & the clouds are just smoke. Cropping out the arm''s body & head give it & its shadow great storytelling power because I get to create most of the story myself. The color, of course, is terrific.', '2011-08-26 20:17:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6528443, 913821, 52995, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and the shallow DOF. Lighting is spot on.</td>', 'I like the angle and the shallow DOF. Lighting is spot on.', '2011-09-05 03:01:56.000000', NULL, 0),
